# Shell scripts, configuration and Dockerfiles must keep LF line endings (the
# images run on Linux even when this repository is cloned on Windows).
* text eol=lf

# Fichiers binaires (polices, images des thèmes de overlay/) : jamais de conversion de fins de ligne.
# Placé APRÈS « * text eol=lf » : la dernière règle gagne.
*.woff2 binary
*.woff binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.phar binary
